        "original_id": "af0ed264-fec9-5c42-8284-24a7e2e9ff84",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bugsy Siegel, Mickey Cohen, David Berman, Harold \"Hooky\" Rothman, Moe Sedway, Jack Dragna, Gus Greenbaum\n- Places: Los Angeles, Las Vegas\n- Organizations: Cohen crime family, L.A. family\n- Products: Flamingo Hotel & Casino\n- Topics: Illegal gambling, prostitution\n\nFacts:\n- Bugsy Siegel ran illegal gambling and prostitution rings in Los Angeles and later in Las Vegas.\n- Bugsy Siegel ran those Los Angeles and Las Vegas operations with lieutenants Mickey Cohen, David Berman, Harold \"Hooky\" Rothman, and Moe Sedway.\n- Jack Dragna was the boss of the L.A. family while Bugsy Siegel ran those operations.\n- After Bugsy Siegel's murder, Moe Sedway and Gus Greenbaum made the Flamingo Hotel & Casino in Las Vegas very successful.",
